              "hideComponent": "false",
              "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
              "text": "<h1><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Sage oral hygiene systems for non-ventilated patients</span></span></span></h1>\n<h2>Designed to help address pneumonia risk factors for non-ventilated dependent and independent patients.</h2>\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Non-ventilator hospital-acquired pneumonia (NV-HAP) can occur on every hospital unit, including in younger, healthy patients.<sup>1</sup></span></p>\n",
              "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Jul 31 2024 14:08:02 GMT+0000",
              "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
              "textIsRich": "true",
              "bottomMargin": "7"
